        "text": "Prior/update/interval: Persistence-plus-year-over-year-growth prior uses the May 2025 level of 6.895 million and a restrained +0.085 million update from prior May growth, partially offset by the November comparable slowdown, giving 6.980 million. Using the target's unadjusted first-print persons-to-millions monthly series for October 2024 through November 2025 (14 observations and 13 successive changes, with no later revisions substituted), sigma = 0.052 million; 1.28*sigma = 0.067 million. The 80% half-width is 0.067 million, so implied bounds are 6.980 - 0.067 = 6.913 and 6.980 + 0.067 = 7.047 million."
